I watch the sea for a long time.
Now it is evening.
So I go towards home.
I know the route now.
I walk straight towards the main road.
Then I go to the right.
The bus stop is right there.
I see it easily.
I do not get lost now.
People are waiting for the bus there.
Soon my bus arrives.
I happily board the bus.
I look outside from the window.
The bus goes towards my home.
I see the map of my city in my mind.
Now I understand the directions well.
Today I am very happy and proud.
